# AutoQAC Project Overview

## Description

AutoQAC is a C# implementation of XEdit-PACT (Plugin Auto Cleaning Tool) using WinUI 3 with MVVM architecture. It automates the cleaning of Bethesda game plugins using xEdit tools.

**Current Stage**: The core app, WinUI 3 shell, cleaning orchestration, backup/restore, and tests are in place.

## Technology Stack

- **.NET 10**: Target framework
- **C# 13**: With nullable reference types enabled
- **WinUI 3 / Windows App SDK 2.2.0**: Windows desktop UI framework
- **CommunityToolkit.Mvvm 8.4.2**: Source-generator MVVM framework
- **Fluent Design**: Native WinUI styling
- **YamlDotNet**: YAML configuration handling
- **xUnit + FluentAssertions**: Testing framework

## Essential Commands

```bash
# Build the project
dotnet build

# Run the application
dotnet run --project AutoQAC

# Run tests
dotnet test

# Build release version
dotnet build -c Release

# Clean build artifacts
dotnet clean
```

## Reference Implementation

The `Code_To_Port/` directory contains reference implementations (Python/Qt and Rust/Slint) for feature reference during development. This directory is **temporary** and will be removed once the C# implementation achieves feature parity.

When implementing new features, check `Code_To_Port/` for equivalent functionality first.
